  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I would like a parameter for Contact Receivers that outputs, as an Int, the number of Senders within its range that have the same Tag as the Receiver.\n\nIt is currently possible to implement this indirectly by using multiple Contacts, but doing so requires a rather complicated setup. It would be preferable if this information could be obtained directly as a parameter from the Contact Receiver.\n\nIf this parameter were implemented, it would make it much easier to determine things such as how many people in the same instance have the same gimmick installed, or whether there are other players within a certain range for player-interaction gimmicks. This could also help reduce the number of Contacts required.",
